   "truncated": false,
   "text": "\r\n\r\nSheryl Baechler, Homer, AK.\nI oppose the DeepGreen Cook Inlet Data Center being proposed underwater to potentially have serious impacts on marine life, local utility rates, and the entire Cook Inlet ecosystem where I live.\r\nWater, land, and energy should be prioritized for life, not data.\r\n\r\n\r\n"
